@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@residentToken = your-resident-supabase-access-token
@adminToken = your-admin-supabase-access-token
@complaintId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@approvalId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@pickupRequestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/health

###

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}

###

# Complaints — resident files a complaint
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/complaints
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickupRequestId": "{{pickupRequestId}}",
  "description": "Collector missed the scheduled pickup."
}

###

# Complaints — admin list (filter/sort/pagination)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/complaints?status=Open&sortBy=createdAt&sortDir=desc&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

# Complaints — view one (admin or owning resident)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

# Complaints — admin update status/notes
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress",
  "adminNotes": "Investigating with the collector."
}

###

# Complaints — admin delete
DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/complaints/{{complaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

# Approvals — admin approve flagged request
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/approvals/{{approvalId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Verified and approved."
}

###

# Approvals — admin reject with reason
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/approvals/{{approvalId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Photo does not show recyclable waste."
}
